<title>INDIA: India Satyam approves hike in FII limit.</title>
<headline>India Satyam approves hike in FII limit.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Satyam Computers Services Ltd on Tuesday said it approved an increase in foreign institutional investors' (FIIs) holding limit to 30 percent from 24 percent.</p>
</text>
